<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>KAIZEN Services — What You Get</title>
</head>
<body class="app-page">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main class="k-page-main">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="k-page-header k-grid-bg" data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow k-eyebrow--center">Full Feature Set</div>
      <h1 class="k-page-h1">What <span class="k-gold">KAIZEN</span> Gives You</h1>
      <p class="k-page-sub">
        Every feature is built around one principle — measurable
        improvement. Free to start. No subscriptions required right now.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- THE IMPROVEMENT ENGINE -->
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">The Improvement Engine</div>
    </div>
    <div class="k-feat-grid" style="margin-bottom:56px;">

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--featured" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="sliders" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">Your Trading System</div>
          <p>
            Define your strategy once: market conditions, setups, entry
            and exit rules, risk rules, trading hours, and your no-trade
            conditions. KAIZEN measures every session against YOUR system
            — because it can't score adherence if it doesn't know the
            plan. As your strategy evolves, your system evolves with it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:60ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="edit-3" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">AI Journal Analysis</div>
          <p>
            Write freeform entries about your trading sessions, backtests,
            or market analysis. KAIZEN AI reads every entry against your
            own stated rules and full session history, then delivers
            specific behavioral feedback — never generic advice.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:120ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="activity" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">Behavioral Insights</div>
          <p>
            Your patterns, detected over time: FOMO after consecutive
            losses, premature entries, discipline dips on Fridays. The
            patterns your P&amp;L will never show — only your journal can
            reveal them.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:180ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="heart" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">Psychology Sessions</div>
          <p>
            A dedicated chat space — separate from your trade journal —
            for working through mindset, fear, anxiety, or financial
            pressure with KAIZEN AI. Discipline failures are often rooted
            in psychology that never shows up in a trade log.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- YOUR PROGRESS -->
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">Your Progress</div>
    </div>
    <div class="k-feat-grid" style="margin-bottom:56px;">

      <div class="k-feat-card k-feat-card--col k-card k-card--featured" data-reveal>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
          <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="bar-chart-2" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
          <div class="k-feat-title" style="margin-bottom:0;">KAIZEN Score</div>
        </div>
        <div class="k-score-demo">
          <%- include('partials/k-dial', { value: 84, size: 120, label: 'KAIZEN Score' }) %>
          <%- include('partials/k-meters', { meters: [
            ['Process', 88],
            ['Risk', 81],
            ['Execution', 85],
            ['Behavior', 79],
            ['Learning & Consistency', 90]
          ] }) %>
        </div>
        <p>
          One number, five dimensions — Process, Risk, Execution,
          Behavior, Learning & Consistency. It measures how you
          traded, not what you made, and updates after every session.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:60ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="trending-up" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">My Progress</div>
          <p>
            Your score history, streaks, and weekly summaries in one
            place. Compare this month's you against last month's you —
            the only trader you're competing with is your past self.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:120ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="award" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">Milestones &amp; Badges</div>
          <p>
            Twenty badges across session counts, consistency streaks, and
            psychology engagement — milestones that mark real behavioral
            progress. Rewards for better decisions, never for trading
            more.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:180ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="archive" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">Memories Archive</div>
          <p>
            Every AI response KAIZEN has ever given you is saved
            permanently. Revisit specific feedback, track how your
            patterns have evolved, and watch your behavioral profile
            develop over weeks and months.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- TOOLS -->
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">Tools</div>
    </div>
    <div class="k-feat-grid" style="margin-bottom:56px;">

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="bar-chart-2" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">Live Charting</div>
          <p>
            Full TradingView-powered charts built into KAIZEN. Analyze the
            market and log your session without switching platforms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="k-feat-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:60ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="mail" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <div>
          <div class="k-feat-title">Weekly AI Summary</div>
          <p>
            A weekly digest of your sessions, score trend, and key
            behavioral patterns — delivered to your inbox every Sunday.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- IDENTITY & VERIFICATION (OPTIONAL) -->
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">Identity &amp; Verification · Optional</div>
      <h2 class="k-title">Verification, kept honest and optional</h2>
      <p class="k-sub k-sub--left">
        You never need a wallet to use KAIZEN. But if you want your
        progress to be provable, verification is there.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="k-verify-grid" style="margin-bottom:56px;">

      <div class="k-verify-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="link" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <h3 class="k-verify-title">Your Wallets</h3>
        <p>
          Connect a Stacks, Ethereum, or other supported wallet to verify
          your identity. Private by default. A verified wallet proves you
          control your address — it says nothing about your trading
          results.
        </p>
        <span class="k-tag">Stacks · Ethereum · More</span>
      </div>

      <div class="k-verify-card k-card k-card--featured" data-reveal style="transition-delay:80ms;">
        <div class="k-seal">認</div>
        <h3 class="k-verify-title">Your Credentials</h3>
        <p>
          Earned milestones can be recorded on the Mantle blockchain so
          anyone can independently verify them. Records currently run on
          a public testnet while the system is young. Journal text is
          never written to any blockchain.
        </p>
        <span class="k-tag">Recorded on Mantle · Testnet</span>
      </div>

      <div class="k-verify-card k-card k-card--hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:160ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge"><i data-feather="globe" width="18" height="18"></i></div>
        <h3 class="k-verify-title">Your Web3 Reputation</h3>
        <p>
          Optionally link your Zero Authority profile to add your Web3
          reputation to your KAIZEN identity. Never required. Never part
          of your score.
        </p>
        <span class="k-tag">Optional</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- COMING SOON -->
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="k-eyebrow">Coming Soon</div>
    </div>
    <div class="k-soon-grid" style="margin-bottom:56px;">

      <div class="k-soon-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="k-icon-badge" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><i data-feather="user" width="14" height="14"></i></div>
        <div class="k-soon-title">Trader Profile</div>
        <p>Your public trader CV — verified sessions, score history, and credentials, all in one page you control.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="k-soon-card" data-reveal style="transition-delay:60ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><i data-feather="credit-card" width="14" height="14"></i></div>
        <div class="k-soon-title">Trader Card</div>
        <p>A portable card that represents your reputation — scan it to see the evidence behind it.</p>
        <span class="k-soon-seal">認</span>
      </div>

      <div class="k-soon-card" data-reveal style="transition-delay:120ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><i data-feather="mic" width="14" height="14"></i></div>
        <div class="k-soon-title">Voice Integration</div>
        <p>Talk to KAIZEN AI about your sessions hands-free.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="k-soon-card" data-reveal style="transition-delay:180ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><i data-feather="smartphone" width="14" height="14"></i></div>
        <div class="k-soon-title">Mobile App</div>
        <p>Native Android and iOS app.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="k-soon-card" data-reveal style="transition-delay:240ms;">
        <div class="k-icon-badge" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><i data-feather="dollar-sign" width="14" height="14"></i></div>
        <div class="k-soon-title">Pro Subscription</div>
        <p>Unlimited AI responses and advanced analytics.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <div class="k-final-cta" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="k-cta-h">All of this, free to start.</h2>
      <p class="k-cta-sub">
        No credit card. No subscriptions. Just honest AI feedback that
        makes you a better trader.
      </p>
      <div class="k-cta-btns">
        <a href="/auth/register" class="btn-primary k-btn-lg">Create Your Account</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/v2-reveal.js"></script>
  <script>feather.replace();</script>
</body>
</html>
